[ti:Uzzu n tasa]
[ar:Lounès Matoub]
[al:Regard sur l'histoire d'un pays damné]
[length:8:35]
[by:Rayane Kch]
[00:49.86] Mi kem-ẓṛiɣ ferḥeɣ
[00:55.06] Nnecṛaḥeɣ
[00:59.45] Nwiɣ tuwḍeḍ lebɣi n wul-im
[01:05.80] Taggara cuwleɣ
[01:10.09] Ttucewwleɣ
[01:14.05] Tdehneḍ-iyi s waṭṭan-im
[01:26.98] Ziɣ kul wa anida yettwaɣ
[01:32.71] Lewqat ssegrarben-aɣ
[01:38.19] Nekk s lmeɛreḍ ttuseqqaɣ
[01:44.52] Ma d kemm txreb-am temẓi-m
[02:06.02] Ay yeṣɛeb wuzzu n tasa
[02:16.22]
[02:30.15] Armi ifut lḥal, i ifut lḥal
[02:39.79] Ay id-tnuḍaḍ amek i ttiliɣ
[02:45.62] D lesnin acḥal
[02:50.39] Ttaɛebga tmal
[02:54.94] A mi kkreɣ ad beddeɣ ad ɣliɣ
[03:05.32] Aleqqḍeɣ deg wussan-iw
[03:10.58] Ma qqneɣ neɣ ɣer ɣur-m uliɣ
[03:16.24] Ad kem-saḥbeɣ di ṛṛwaḥ-iw
[03:22.48] Diri-yi s yisem gliɣ
[03:44.94] Ay yeṣɛeb wuzzu n tasa
[03:55.25]
[04:10.20] Acimi trewleḍ, acimi trewleḍ
[04:18.90] Acimi ur d-tnuḍaḍ ara
[04:25.18] Deg wul tcewḍeḍ
[04:29.74] Deg wul-im ad tkennfeḍ
[04:34.31] Ay imi-m tesgugen-it leḥya
[04:44.48] Teǧǧiḍ axxam thujreḍ
[04:50.95] Teɣliḍ-d deg urebbi n wayeḍ
[04:56.12] S ufus-im i t-textareḍ
[05:02.48] Ul i d amedya n tama
[05:11.59]
[05:25.62] Tesɛiḍ dderya, tesɛiḍ dderya
[05:34.99] Ass-a mačči n yiman-im
[05:41.32] Ur d iyi-d-tṣaḥeḍ ara
[05:45.68] Ur d iyi-d-tṣaḥeḍ ara
[05:50.09] Xas muḥal teqdem tayri-m
[06:00.52] Asirem yeǧǧa allaɣ-iw
[06:06.78] Di cceqfan i tṛuḥ temẓi-w
[06:12.81] Yidem ur d-yegra lmektub-iw
[06:20.35] Ḥerz-iyi kan deg ul-im (llah llah)
[06:43.49] Ay yeṣɛeb wuzzu n tasa
[06:52.52]
[07:06.56] Mi d-tebderḍ isem-iw, mi d-tebderḍ isem-iw
[07:15.58] Ay ttru snefsusi lhemm-im
[07:21.63] Limer am lɣeṛḍ-iw, am lɣeṛḍ-iw
[07:30.48] Ad d-telhiḍ deg wexxam-im
[07:42.20] Nekk yid-m kullec yekfa
[07:48.79] Ssuq usirem yefra
[07:54.25] Xas ul-im ur d-yeqḍa ara
[08:00.29] Ay ddem awi ṣṣber d aɛwin-im
[08:22.29] Acmux n tayri yebḍa
[08:33.48]